@startsalt
' purpose: resolved OpenCode-only loading surface with shared run categories and current seed step
' covers: packages/lib/proveo-await-seed
' covers: packages/lib/test_opencode_startup.py
' covers: e2e/opencode_seed_progress_test.go
' Logic: _spec/packages/lib/opencode-seed-progress.puml
' 2026-10-17, D2 (_spec/defs/opencode/engine-local-history.puml): the seed no longer stages
' session history, so the "credentials: staging legacy session history" step is gone from the
' frames; opencode_startup.py, the Python consumer, is deleted (MEASURED absent) and its covers
' dropped.
title OpenCode seed wait — current operation, not a blank screen
{
  {^"TTY: seed pending"
    Waiting for seed | workspace: preparing checkout and shared folders | 2s | [/]
  }
  {^"PIPE: seed pending"
    Waiting for seed | workspace: preparing checkout and shared folders | 0s
    Waiting for seed | setup: rendering agents | 4s
  }
}
legend
TTY redraws one stderr row with rotating ASCII frames.
PIPE prints step changes and five-second heartbeats.
Categories match run logs; details name the active operation.
Release, refusal, timeout and signals remove the transient TTY row.
Only OpenCode enables this surface by default.
endlegend
@endsalt
